ame{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡{135}^{∘}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{135}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256148 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "69e91ce7-259a-5a11-bb79-7e6ad7ea86d4" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying Expressions in Degrees Using the Sum and Difference Formulas"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0941ee6d-6d0a-594c-a9d6-50b40cfb4281" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256150} {:answer/id #uuid "7dcabd06-0834-5aa6-a3d4-6c413742b650" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256151} {:answer/id #uuid "4a27ba5d-3ad3-5937-8e11-ee515c09e897" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256152} {:answer/id #uuid "160a97d9-5f1c-51e0-a73e-a823c26ba23d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256153} {:answer/id #uuid "b852c91c-0173-5188-bb4c-cf3ae5b0621d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256154}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7dcabd06-0834-5aa6-a3d4-6c413742b650" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256151} :answer-field/id #uuid "49f581e8-d986-5ba1-a37b-139bed06a128" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256149}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "40a945cb-6aa6-5c39-9d08-437421c44c37" :question/math-academy-id "q-141275" :question/problem "$\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-{120}^{∘})=$" :question/worked-solution "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v-\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v={120}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-{120}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡{120}^{∘}-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{120}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256155 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "69e91ce7-259a-5a11-bb79-7e6ad7ea86d4" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying Expressions in Degrees Using the Sum and Difference Formulas"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3fd6e9a9-449d-5caa-b5ae-3db8ea8ea260" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256157} {:answer/id #uuid "f408b04f-d327-5da0-9c90-9b2720231a75" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186256158} {:answer/id #uuid "a9ae4ef0-79d8-5ce1-8e7b-a825ccbe7112" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\opera